<!--
  Veyro Debloat Engine — launcher icon (placeholder vector).

  HOW TO DROP IN YOUR CUSTOM PNG / WEBP:
  1. Export your artwork at these sizes (square; keep important art inside the
     central 66/108 safe zone, i.e. the middle ~61% of the canvas):
        mipmap-mdpi    108x108
        mipmap-hdpi    162x162
        mipmap-xhdpi   216x216
        mipmap-xxhdpi  324x324
        mipmap-xxxhdpi 432x432
  2. Name them ic_launcher_foreground.webp (and ic_launcher_round.webp for a
     round variant) and drop them into the matching res/mipmap-*dpi/ folders.
     Bitmap drawables in mipmap-*dpi OVERRIDE this vector automatically —
     no XML change is needed.
  3. To swap the background, edit @color/ic_launcher_background in
     values/colors.xml, or replace res/drawable/ic_launcher_background.xml.
  4. Remove these mipmap-*dpi webp files again to return to vector-only.
-->
